  "description": "ResultType is a lightweight C# library that implements the Result pattern for better error handling in .NET applications. It provides a strongly-typed Result<T> type that encapsulates success or failure outcomes, making it easier to handle errors without exceptions. Features include:\n\n- Fluent API for result handling\n- ASP.NET Core integration for API responses\n- Built-in FluentValidation support\n- Comprehensive error details\n- Extension methods for common operations\n- Thread-safe implementation",
